stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Submitted: owner submits
  Submitted --> AutoScreening
  AutoScreening --> Published: low risk + rules pass
  AutoScreening --> PendingReview: uncertain/high risk
  AutoScreening --> Rejected: hard policy violation
  PendingReview --> Published: moderator approves
  PendingReview --> ChangesRequested: incomplete/repairable
  PendingReview --> Rejected: violation
  ChangesRequested --> Draft: owner edits
  Published --> Suspended: report/risk/manual action
  Suspended --> Published: restored
  Published --> Expired: expiry job
  Expired --> Published: renew + recheck
  Draft --> Deleted: owner deletes
  Published --> Archived: owner archives
  Rejected --> Appealed: owner appeals
  Appealed --> Published: appeal succeeds
  Appealed --> Rejected: appeal denied
  Archived --> [*]
  Deleted --> [*]
